Proposed Solution
1. Solution Overview

The proposed solution is a Script-Controlled ACL system implemented in ServiceNow to restrict access to institution records based on field values and user roles.

2. User Management

Authorized users are created and assigned the required roles.

3. Role Management

Different roles are used to control access for specific operations.

4. Record Management

Institution information is maintained in the u_institution_details table.

5. Access Management

ACLs are configured to control READ, CREATE, WRITE, and DELETE operations.

6. Branch-Based Restriction

The Branch field is used to determine whether the user can access the applicable record.

7. Administrator Access

Administrators retain full access to manage records and security configurations.

8. Expected Result

Unauthorized access is prevented while authorized users can perform their permitted operations.
